      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://traveltusc.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2026, Tuscarawas County will mark the 250th anniversary of the Declaration of Independence with community celebrations.",
